{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-ring-home", "R-index-home-in", "R-index-home"],
  "note": "Define a=L-pinky-top, b=L-ring-home, c=R-pinky-top, d=R-index-home, e=R-index-home-in. T1 chord {a,b,e,c_old}={F,V,W,X}; a,b,e all-diff each ∈{F,V,W,X}; after T1 rotation on {L-index-home,R-index-home,c}, so c_old not tracked. T2 chord {a,b,c,d} => {D,F,W,X}. Thus a,b are the 2 letters from {F,W,X} (V∉{a,b}). Let t be the remaining letter in {F,W,X} not on {a,b}; then {c,d}={D,t}. Rot after T2: {L-ring-bottom,R-index-top-in,R-middle-home}. Plan T3 press {a,b,e,d} to see if d=D (D appears) and if e=V (V appears)."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-middle-bottom", "R-middle-home", "R-index-home"],
  "note": "T7: R-index-home-in=S (rotated after: L-middle-home,R-index-home). Fixed now: L-pinky-top=W; L-middle-bottom=V; R-pinky-top=D; R-middle-home=Z; R-index-home-in=S. T8 press {L-pinky-top,L-middle-bottom,R-middle-home,R-index-home}; returned set {W,V,Z,x} => x=R-index-home at press time. If rotation after includes R-index-home, then x not fixed post-rot."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-middle-home", "R-middle-top", "R-ring-home"],
  "note": "After T18: L-pinky-top=W, L-pinky-bottom=R, L-ring-top=P, L-ring-home=F, L-ring-bottom=A, L-middle-top=O, L-index-top=H, R-index-home=U, R-middle-home=Z. T19 plan chord [L-pinky-top, L-middle-home, R-middle-top, R-ring-home] to resolve L-middle-home,R-middle-top,R-ring-home from {W,?,?,?}."
}
